          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">The base of the Omega Worm counts as an Entry Edge. Each Round, Friendly Units with a combined Supply cost of 2 or less may be Deployed via this Entry Edge.

