          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">Use when another Friendly Biological Unit (including a Structure) suffers Damage Within 4&quot;. Reduce the Total Damage before allocation by 2.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="1696-5ea7-559b-bb8b">Reaction (1 BM)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psionic Link" id="de73-a1a6-e4fe-300d" hidden="false" typeId="a305-fb8b-8be3-f0fe" typeName="Rules (Any Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">Once per Round, if there are at least 7 Friendly models Within 6&quot; of this Unit, it may resolve its Special Ability with the BM cost reduced by 1.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="1696-5ea7-559b-bb8b">Passive</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Broodmother" id="1060-a9d6-8c5d-e172" hidden="false" typeId="ec1d-63b8-de26-1894" typeName="Rules (Movement Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Apply one of the following effects to all Friendly units (Line of Sight is not required). You cannot apply the effect chosen in the previous Game Round:
- Units of Size 1 gain a +1 Modifier to all IMPACT Rolls.
- All weapons of Size 2 Units gain CRITICAL HIT (1).
- Units of Size 3 or more gain TOUGH (1).</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e11e-d579-0142-8de4">Active (1 BM)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Infested Drop" id="8954-0656-ce63-8c7c" hidden="false" typeId="ec1d-63b8-de26-1894" typeName="Rules (Movement Phase)">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">The base of the Zagara counts as an Entry Edge. Each Round, Friendly Units with a combined Supply cost of 1 may be Deployed via this Entry Edge.</characteristic>
