          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="616e-c7be-abff-a2bf">When this Unit resolves a Special Ability that costs BM, it can remove one model from a Friendly Unit Within 4&quot; to generate 1 BM to spend towards that ability’s cost.</characteristic>
