                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="97a6-bd65-3d58-17e9">You may spend 1 to 3 BM to activate this ability. Set a Plague Blast Template Wholly Within 10&quot; and Line of Sight of this Unit. For each Unit that has at least one model whose base is partially covered by the template, roll 2 dice, plus 1 additional die for each model in that Unit whose base is partially covered. That Unit loses its HIDDEN Status, and, depending on the BM spent, it suffers NON-LETHAL DAMAGE (1) for:
- 1 BM: each result of 5+.
- 2 BM: each result of 4+.
- 3 BM: each result of 3+.</characteristic>
